window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>He's the man who ruined her life</b></p> <p>I never intended to take Sara. But once I saw her, I knew I'd do anything to keep her.</p> <p>Kidnapping her was easy.</p> <p>Now I must earn her love and keep her. </p> <p><b>She's his entire world</b></p> <p>I should hate Peter Sokolov.</p> <p>He's a criminal, a mercenary who killed my husband.</p> <p>So why am I falling for my tormentor?</p> <p>This convenient bundle contains the last two books of the Tormentor Mine series:<i> Destiny Mine</i> and <i>Forever Mine</i>.</p>"; 
